@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Weekly / Monthly Progress Report Generation

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    ActorBorderColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #777777
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
}
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

actor User
participant "Web Dashboard" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as Backend
participant "Analytics Service" as Analytics
database "MySQL Database" as DB
participant "AI Summary Service" as AISummary
participant "LLM / AI API" as LLM
participant "Report Generator" as ReportGen

User -> Frontend: Request weekly/monthly report
Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/reports/generate?period=weekly
Backend -> DB: Retrieve profile, logs,\ngoals, and body records
DB --> Backend: Raw user data
Backend -> Analytics: Compute comparative analytics
Analytics -> Analytics: Calculate workout summary
Analytics -> Analytics: Calculate nutrition summary
Analytics -> Analytics: Calculate calorie and weight trends
Analytics -> Analytics: Calculate goal progress
Analytics --> Backend: Aggregated indicators

Backend -> AISummary: Prepare summary context
AISummary -> LLM: Request natural-language summary
LLM --> AISummary: Return AI summary and suggestions
AISummary --> Backend: Validated summary

Backend -> ReportGen: Build report document
ReportGen -> ReportGen: Render charts, metrics,\nsummary, and recommendations
ReportGen --> Backend: PDF/HTML report
Backend -> DB: Save report metadata
DB --> Backend: Save success
Backend --> Frontend: Return report link / preview
Frontend --> User: Display report and export option
@enduml
